ad.\",\"evidence\":[\"Stage Three clinical trials\",\"treatment resistant PTSD\",\"You can’t take SSRI’s and do MDMA therapy.\",\"somatic (meaning, physical)\"]},{\"id\":\"forced_synesthesia\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"A no-finding call is plausible, but the annotator supplied no evidence from across the document to substantiate it.\",\"evidence\":[\"It hit me like a Cat 5 hurricane, and everything in my life changed.\",\"It’s more of a good intensity, like a really hard workout\",\"I think a big part of the “hollow” feeling is the fear of letting go of my anger.\"]},{\"id\":\"generic_metaphors\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The cited simile is a generic intensity marker rather than a concrete description of the experience, so the flag is justified.\",\"evidence\":[\"It hit me like a Cat 5 hurricane, and everything in my life changed.\"]},{\"id\":\"referential_clarity\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The clearance may be correct, but the annotator offered no supporting evidence despite the document's length and density.\",\"evidence\":[\"What matters is the experience.\",\"This was different.\",\"That to me was astounding.\"]},{\"id\":\"formulaic_parallelism\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The later sentence deliberately reuses the earlier three-part mantra, and the symmetrical form does some of the reporting work for it.\",\"evidence\":[\"Trust the medicine.\",\"Surrender to the medicine.\",\"Receive what comes up.\",\"I trusted the medicine, surrendered to it, and received what came up.\"]},{\"id\":\"semantic_redundancy\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The flagged summary repeats the immediately preceding point that MDMA is not sufficient by itself and that the person still must do the painful work.\",\"evidence\":[\"MDMA is not a treatment for trauma *by itself*.\",\"You still have to do work before it and after MDMA to really get the impact.\",\"if you want to treat your trauma, you still have to face the pain. MDMA just makes it much easier to do that.\"]},{\"id\":\"underspecified_language\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"Each flagged phrase relies on evaluative wording without yet naming the criterion or observable basis, so the under-specification call is warranted.\",\"evidence\":[\"It was a deeply profound and life-changing experience.\",\"Honestly, I felt super sharp mentally.\",\"It’s more of a good intensity, like a really hard workout — but you can rest during if you need to.\"]},{\"id\":\"context_leakage\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The no-finding judgment is plausible, but the annotator gave no evidence showing that the document remains self-contained rather than replying to absent chat context.\",\"evidence\":[\"I know, I want to vomit that I wrote that,\",\"Don’t worry, I’m not going to dance around with fucking glow sticks, but now I get why people did it.\",\"Please know: these notes were written stream of consciousness\"]},{\"id\":\"performed_candour\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"These frames announce sincerity without adding propositional content; the underlying claims could stand directly.\",\"evidence\":[\"If I’m being honest, I think I failed at meditation.\",\"I have to be honest: I was afraid going into the second session.\",\"Quite honestly — I got lucky.\"]},{\"id\":\"vacuous_connection\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The clearance may be right, but the annotator supplied no evidence to show that the document's connections are adequately specified.\",\"evidence\":[\"Given the data, and the first hand accounts I heard from several friends, and the fact that nothing else was working anymore, I decided to try it.\",\"And this is where I missed an opportunity.\",\"In short: if you want to treat your trauma, you still have to face the pain.\"]},{\"id\":\"genre_specific\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"This piece does not fit the list